{"4665670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solvestia", "steam_appid": 4665670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening with no memory in a vast cosmic playground, rediscover the world one piece at a time. Journey back through a timeline of memories, each of them containing breadcrumbs that raise more questions than answers, with each expanding your ability to interface with the world.<br><br>Make connections between seemingly disparate memories by interacting with the mystical wildlife around you. By making connections between them in your journal, you can begin to unwind the larger, enigmatic narrative.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening with no memory in a vast cosmic playground, rediscover the world one piece at a time. Journey back through a timeline of memories, each of them containing breadcrumbs that raise more questions than answers, with each expanding your ability to interface with the world.<br><br>Make connections between seemingly disparate memories by interacting with the mystical wildlife around you. By making connections between them in your journal, you can begin to unwind the larger, enigmatic narrative.</p>", "short_description": "Solvestia is a whimsical isometric puzzle game where you repair your understanding of the world through magic-infused ecosystems. Dive into memories to uncover secrets that allow you to repair your reality. Fix relationships between mystical flora and fauna to rediscover yourself.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665670/0fe63692ea6a7d195b8c0831aeb05427edf9e9d0/header.jpg?t=1786578517", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4665670/b53ddce09618c350e703f77360f1600c34ce90f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786578517", "capsul